    <%= pro_site_name %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    When you cancel your account:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      You'll lose access to any requests you still have in draft.
    </li>

    <li>
      You won't be able to access <%= pro_site_name %> tools, including the
      dashboard and pro request management.
    </li>

    <li>
      You will still be able to see any requests which are currently private,
      but you won't be able to make new private requests or extend privacy
